Output demo.gif

Set FontSize 15
Set FontFamily "Cascadia Code"
Set Width 960
Set Height 580
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set LetterSpacing 0

Hide
Type "cd packages/sdk-ts"
Enter
Type "cls"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "npx -y tsx src/demo.ts"
Enter

Sleep 7s

Sleep 5s